Tesseract 5.5.3 on Android: no cpu_features dependency; NEON detection via getauxval.

CMakeLists.txt requires Google's cpu_features (CpuFeaturesNdkCompat) on Android
but never defines HAVE_ANDROID_GETCPUFAMILY, so the library is linked and never
used. It also never defines HAVE_GETAUXVAL, so on armeabi-v7a
SIMDDetect::neon_available_ stays false and the NEON dot-product and
int-matrix kernels are compiled but never selected. Bionic has had getauxval()
since API 18 (mediahro-deps targets API 29), so define HAVE_GETAUXVAL and drop
cpu_features. arm64-v8a (NEON always on) and x86_64 (cpuid) are unchanged.

